OL,3,GNEWSAHow drier summers could change
OL,4,ALondon's parks
OL,5,
OL,6,FLondon may have to change what it
OL,7,Fplants and how it looks after its green
OL,8,Fspaces as hotter and drier summers put
OL,9,Fincreasing pressure on water supplies.
OL,11,FThames Water, which supplies most of
OL,12,Fthe capital, said water levels had not
OL,13,Fyet recovered from this year's
OL,14,Frecord-breaking hot summer, with
OL,15,Fsustained rainfall needed before it
OL,16,Fcould consider lifting hosepipe
OL,17,Frestrictions.
OL,19,FThe conditions are prompting some of
OL,20,FLondon's green spaces, including Kew
OL,21,FGardens and the Royal Parks, to rethink
OL,22,Fhow they plan for the future.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
