OL,3,GNEWSAHow drier summers could change
OL,4,ALondon's parks
OL,5,
OL,6,FSome trees could see their lifespans
OL,7,Fshortened by prolonged heat, while more
OL,8,Fdrought-resistant plants could become a
OL,9,Fcommon sight across the capital.
